# AI output style

- Use meaningful, descriptive names for functions, variables, and types.
- **Never** emit emoji or emoji-lookalikes (e.g. `✓`, `✗`, `❌`, `✅`, `🚀`) in code, commit messages, PR bodies, tool output, or user-facing text. Exception: a test that deliberately exercises multi-byte / unicode handling.
- Never write commented-out code. Delete it. If a reader needs the removed alternative, put it in the PR description or the commit message body.
